sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor U as Player
  participant App as Unity Client
  participant Auth as UGS Auth
  participant Lobby as Presence Lobby
  participant Party as Party Session (Relay)

  U->>App: Launch → Bootstrap → Authentication
  App->>Auth: SignInAnonymouslyAsync()
  Auth-->>App: signed in (PlayerId)
  App->>Lobby: JoinOrCreate (PRESENCE_LOBBY tag)
  App->>Party: EnsurePartySessionAsync() — eager solo Relay
  Note over App,Party: Always-InParty — you host your own session from Menu_Main onward

  U->>App: Tap + to invite a friend
  App->>Lobby: write invite_target + invite_data (player props)
  Lobby-->>App: recipient refresh scan detects invite
  U->>App: recipient presses Accept
  App->>Party: shutdown solo NM → JoinSessionById(host)
  Party-->>App: client connected + scene synced
  App->>App: host spawns joiner vessel (autopilot)
  Note over U,Party: Both fly together — each toggles its own freestyle locally
